{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10123020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10123020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012302001:0":{"text":"이건 대체 뭐지? 너무 무섭게 생겼어!","source_cn":"这到底是什么东西？它长得太吓人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x285B76DEB9DD0D3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012302002:0":{"text":"이것들은 검은 나비와 함께 두 번이나 나타났어요. 아든 선생님이 나비를 따라가라고 했으니 무슨 연관이 있을지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"它们两次伴随着黑色蝴蝶出现，而雅顿老师让我们跟着蝴蝶，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x072282E22F244CB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012302003:0":{"text":"꼭 나비를 따라가야 해? 그럼 파란 나비를 따라가자... 적어도 그 나비들은 미샤르테의 메신저니까.","source_cn":"非得跟着蝴蝶吗？那起码跟着蓝色闪蝶吧……至少它们是弥萨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A0FCDBDB42E872F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012302004:0":{"text":"불평은 그만해. 어쩌면 달빛 그림자로 가는 유일한 방법일지도 몰라.","source_cn":"别抱怨了，这或许是前往月影乡的唯一方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BF91B54F880F280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count